Package: JABBAHCR
Title: Test Index-based Linear HCR using JABBA model projections
Version: 0.95
Authors@R: 
    person("Paul", "Medley", , "paulahmedley@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This is an extension to the stock assessment state space
    production model JABBA that allows testing of index-based linear
    harvest control rules against projections of the JABBA model. This is
    a management strategy evaluation in that the linear index-based HCR is
    simpler than the JABBA production operating model. This package is able to
    test whether an HCR achieves objectives based on a series of plausible
    JABBA modelfits.
